/ Test: sign with short TTL, wait, verify fails as expired — not as any other refusal
Start
- set %data% = { "payload": "expiring" }
- sign %data%, expires in 50 ms, write to %signed%
- wait for 60 ms
- verify %signed%, on error call HandleExpired
- assert %errorKey% equals "Expired", "expired signature should fail verification"

HandleExpired
- set %errorKey% = %!error.Key%
